  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נֵר אֱלֹהִים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נִשְׁמַת אָדָם.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְנֵר אֱלֹהִים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">טֶרֶם יִכְבֶּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וַיִּפַּח בְּאַפָּיו<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נִשְׁמַת חַיִּים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵשׁ חַיָּיו<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא תִכְבֶּה.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"145\"><div><p data-end=\"178\" data-start=\"100\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תְּכַבֶּה אֶת הָאוֹר - זְכֹר לְמִי הוּא שַׁיָּךְ.</span></p></div></span><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p>מְעַט מִן הָאוֹר דּוֹחֶה הַרְבֵּה מִן הַחֹשֶׁךְ (ספר התניא)</p></span></div><div><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"לְהַעֲלֹת נֵר תָּמִיד\" = 1239 =&nbsp;\"תְּנוּ לַי-ה-וָ-ה אֱלֹהֵיכֶם כָּבוֹד בְּטֶרֶם יַחְשִׁךְ\" (ירמיהו י״ג, ט״ז).<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כבדוהו בטרם יחשיך השמש וידמה היום כלילה (עפ\"י רד\"ק)</span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p></span><p style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>תָּמִיד</b>' / '<b>תְּדִירָא</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ לעולם, ללא הפסק - תדיר</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>כָּתִית</b>' / '<b>כָּתִישָׁא</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;כתות, מרוסק - כתוש</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>אֹהֶל מוֹעֵד</b>' / '<b>מַשְׁכַּן זִמְנָא</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ בית ההתוועדות - משכן הזימון</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>לְכַהֵן</b>' / '<b>לְשַׁמָּשָׁא</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;לשאת תפקיד קדוש - לשמש בתפקיד</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>מִשְׁפָּט</b>' / '<b>דִּינָא</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ משפט - דין</span></span></span></span></li></ol><span><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><br /></span></h2><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right; margin-left: 1em; text-align: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGDRizvB9ON75VhBw15b7oWOu-FObAUGBmJ7qOXPv4QQhltc2BCG_eC13NB0ulZm94oUG3ZnASx2X5XFo3XAcAMl_NHG6iXM9m_XTv0p595hAhCMVUYqJ02cUdEokPLS48MqXZtES1WvgMu7omxu8v2VOl4xt_r51NhThQ5IUCe9e0dKy0peVrPp9tLXY/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Nov%2026,%202025,%2008_56_20%20PM.png\" style=\"clear: right; display: inline; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"מסך טלפון חשוך המציג סמל סוללה כמעט ריקה עם נקודת אור קטנה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGDRizvB9ON75VhBw15b7oWOu-FObAUGBmJ7qOXPv4QQhltc2BCG_eC13NB0ulZm94oUG3ZnASx2X5XFo3XAcAMl_NHG6iXM9m_XTv0p595hAhCMVUYqJ02cUdEokPLS48MqXZtES1WvgMu7omxu8v2VOl4xt_r51NhThQ5IUCe9e0dKy0peVrPp9tLXY/w133-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Nov%2026,%202025,%2008_56_20%20PM.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גם כשאתה 'על אחוזים'<br />עדיין אפשר להאיר</span></td></tr></tbody></table></span><br /><br /></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p>"
}
